Error [E0355]: `#allow` cannot suppress `allow_reason`
  --> tests/ui/gate_law/allow_reason_cannot_suppress_itself.jet:1:19
    |
  1 | fn run() { #allow(allow_reason, "cannot disable the audit") print("done") }
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The reason check audits the lint allowance itself and cannot be disabled by that allowance
 Fix: Write the reason slot: `#allow(lint_name, "why this lint does not apply")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0355
